// Park staff roles (StaffRole). The park employs a number of each (Crew menu → Park staff); each is paid
// wagePerDayCents at the end of every day. coversPer: what one of them looks after –
//   supervision (park manager): people (staff and crew beyond staffRules.freeHeadcount); too few managers and everyone
//     else works worse (down to staffRules.supervisionFloorPermille);
//   tickets (ticket office): visitors a day; too few and arrivals queue (mood) or turn back;
//   firstAid: built trails and lifts in service; too few and the helicopter takes longer, minor crashes hurt more;
//   cleaning: visitors a day (each building counts as staffRules.facilityCleaningVisitors); too few and mood sinks;
//   marketing: demand in permille for the first marketer (n of them: 2n/(n+1) times that).
// maxCount: the most the park can employ; requiredLevel: the park level needed to employ any.
